      },
      "text": "PEST POPULATION\n    -> Below threshold: no intervention\n    -> Above threshold: choose intervention option\n         - Cultural control\n         - Biological control\n         - Chemical control\n       Combine intelligently => INTEGRATED PEST MANAGEMENT (IPM)"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-ECONOMIC-ENTOMOLOGY.md#005",
      "path": [
