      "text": "APHIDS (Hemiptera: Aphididae)\n  Direct damage: phloem feeding -> wilt, honeydew -> sooty mold\n  Indirect damage: virus vectors (PVY, CMV, BYDV, CTV)\n  Life history: parthenogenetic explosive growth; winged dispersal\n  Key species: Myzus persicae (green peach), Aphis gossypii (cotton),\n               Rhopalosiphum padi (bird cherry-oat), Acyrthosiphon pisum (pea)\n  Control: selective aphicides, parasitoid wasps (Aphidius), lacewings"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-ECONOMIC-ENTOMOLOGY.md#010",
      "path": [
        "08-ECONOMIC-ENTOMOLOGY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
