      },
      "text": "THRIPS (Thysanoptera: Thripidae)\n  Frankliniella occidentalis: western flower thrips\n    Feeding damage + Tospoviruses (TSWV, INSV) -- major greenhouse pest\n    Cryptic behavior: flowers, leaf folds; difficult to monitor\n  Thrips palmi: tropical; melon, pepper\n  Control: blue/yellow sticky traps; predatory mites (Amblyseius); spinosad"
    },
