      "text": "SPIDER MITES (Arachnida, not insects, but managed in economic entomology)\n  Tetranychus urticae: two-spotted spider mite\n    Chelicerate; not Insecta -- but canonically included in IPM textbooks\n    Cell-content feeders; thrive in hot/dry conditions; rapid resistance\n```"
