      "text": "NOCTUIDAE (owlet moths) -- most damaging family:\n  Helicoverpa armigera (cotton bollworm): global; polyphagous; Bt resistant\n  Heliothis virescens (tobacco budworm)\n  Spodoptera frugiperda (fall armyworm): major grass/corn pest; Africa invasion 2016\n  Spodoptera exigua (beet armyworm): vegetable crops\n  Mythimna separata (armyworm): small grains, Asia"
