      "text": "STORED GRAIN PESTS:\n  Sitophilus granarius/oryzae (grain weevil): inside grain kernels\n  Tribolium castaneum/confusum (flour beetles): surface feeders\n  Callosobruchus maculatus: legume bruchid; endemic in tropical storage"
