      "text": "BARK BEETLES (Curculionidae: Scolytinae):\n  Dendroctonus frontalis (southern pine beetle): epidemic outbreaks kill stands\n  Dendroctonus ponderosae (mountain pine beetle): 50M ha killed in BC alone\n  Ips typographus (European spruce bark beetle): post-windstorm outbreaks\n  Mechanism: pheromone mass attack; blue-stain fungus carried by beetle\n  Threshold: trees withstand <10 attacks/m^2 bark; mass attack overwhelms resin"
